{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：中国婴幼儿配方奶粉线下销售额跌幅扩大至13%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国婴幼儿配方奶粉市场的调整仍在持续。GS最新一期行业追踪报告显示，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年5-6月，尼尔森口径的线下奶粉销售额同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>，较3-4月<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>的降幅有所扩大。同期线上表现相对更弱，7月天猫、淘宝、京东三大平台合计销售额同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>，其中京东单平台跌幅达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告覆盖了飞鹤、伊利、蒙牛、达能、a2等主要品牌的最新渠道数据。整体看，行业仍处于量价双弱的调整期，但品牌之间的分化比大盘数字更值得关注。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXwohX9Vc52ZgbfSBaUNAenPJ2Tl8Fo1qlhyyk4dEg97hUtKVgpZcGJA9aSsiaFk8oYQOTVGTfIgRiab3GAJdB3DvoYmEaxibav74/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 线下渠道量跌<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.6%</span>，均价微升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.7%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看线下整体情况。5-6月线下销售额同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>，其中销量贡献了主要影响，同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.6%</span>，较3-4月扩大约5个百分点。均价同比微增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.7%</span>，基本持平，说明价格层面没有出现明显变化，但也没有出现修复。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分渠道看，母婴店和现代商超渠道跌幅接近，均为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>左右。母婴店销量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.4%</span>，现代商超渠道销量跌幅更深。报告特别提示，尼尔森自<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2024</span>年5-6月起调整了数据基数，同比口径与此前不完全可比。</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #AAB4C3;background:#F7F8FA;color:#4B5565;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC观察：</strong> 先看销量和均价的分化——销量跌幅扩大5个百分点，均价却还能微增，说明这轮下滑不是靠降价换来的，而是需求端的真实调整。我更关注的是接下来两个季度销量跌幅能否收窄，如果连续三个季度维持双位数下滑，行业出清节奏会比市场预期更慢。</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUyibuLhBqJ6SU48fnKcxE6UYhPr3MJSzkNZdicjLymGEqicM8abICrGUFYDFSGtGlnMXZRL89PSyh2HzN2RIxMNw5jAX1Ntjv57E/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 国产头部集中度提升，外资份额持续变化</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">品牌格局的变化比大盘数字更有信息量。5-6月，飞鹤、伊利、蒙牛、君乐宝、合生元等国产头部品牌合计市场份额达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">63.5%</span>，较3-4月进一步提升。其中飞鹤份额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21.3%</span>，环比微增0.3个百分点；合生元表现较为突出，销售额同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24.5%</span>，份额从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.5%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.4%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">外资品牌整体<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span>。主要跨国品牌价值份额同比下降1.5个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22.3%</span>，其中惠氏份额同比下滑1.2个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.2%</span>，雀巢下滑0.6个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.2%</span>。达能是少数实现增长的跨国品牌，份额同比提升0.5个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">伊利线下表现好于行业整体，5-6月销售额同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.5%</span>，明显好于行业<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>的降幅，但较3-4月<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.9%</span>的正增长明显走弱。蒙牛（不含雅士利）线下同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.9%</span>，增速较3-4月的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.6%</span>有所变化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWXzib7bdm1xqdZKtfoTSCHjrXPKk1OdOfgxGoPSnBUuUHu8iaoTXw8aCVP8icXicMtCm2ib0LHiabIq5LbJ9skxMFD3PjHuBSibLAa9o/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. a2奶粉5-6月销售额同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67%</span>，供应链影响集中显现</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告里最突出的单一品牌数据来自a2。5-6月，a2在母婴店渠道的销售额同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67%</span>，而同期整个母婴店市场跌幅为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>。报告将这一异常下滑归因于供应链约束，并称这是供应中断影响的集中体现。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">a2的ASP也在持续下滑，5-6月同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.3%</span>，较3-4月<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.3%</span>的降幅明显扩大。线上渠道同样<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span>，7月a2在天猫、淘宝、京东合计销售额同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13%</span>，但较6月<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>的降幅有所收窄。</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #AAB4C3;background:#F7F8FA;color:#4B5565;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\">KC观察： <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">67%</span>的跌幅已经超出正常需求波动的解释范围，更像是供给端出现了问题。报告提到供应链约束，但没有展开具体环节。</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXcZ8efEl4ORWonD1QWOFMNfISyEBtMRKnz8skqVqeywl6eAftSBGCuJcnFzpur16bS4M9BnFSsotGlXN3eOT8w1FHBCXwSP2c/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 25-GS-China Consumer Staples-China Infant Formula Tracker- Nielsen offline market decline widened to 13- -May-Jun -26-- Online sales decline widened to 18</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
